---
layout: layouts/story-brand.njk
title: Ferni — Someone's still here at 3:47 AM
description: A voice you can talk to anytime. Ferni remembers your story, hears what you're not saying, and never runs out of patience.
bodyClass: home-3am
footerShowHero: false
styles:
  - home-3am.css
---
{#
  HOME — "3:47 AM"
  One night, told in seven chapters. The sky moves from night to morning as you
  scroll; each chapter carries its own timestamp. Copy uses only claims made
  elsewhere on the site (FAQ, Give, blog). Behaviour: /js/home-3am.js.
#}
{% set persons = [
  { id: "ferni",  name: "Ferni",  role: "Brings the team together",   url: "/team/ferni/" },
  { id: "maya",   name: "Maya",   role: "Habits that actually stick",  url: "/team/maya/" },
  { id: "peter",  name: "Peter",  role: "Digs into the research",      url: "/team/peter/" },
  { id: "jordan", name: "Jordan", role: "Turns dreams into plans",     url: "/team/jordan/" },
  { id: "alex",   name: "Alex",   role: "Finds the right words",       url: "/team/alex/" },
  { id: "nayan",  name: "Nayan",  role: "Wisdom for the long game",    url: "/team/nayan/" }
] %}

{% macro eyes(cls = "") %}<svg class="ferni-eyes-svg {{ cls }}" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="36" cy="50" rx="10" ry="12" fill="white"/><circle cx="33" cy="45" r="2.5" fill="white" opacity="0.9"/><ellipse cx="64" cy="50" rx="10" ry="12" fill="white"/><circle cx="61" cy="45" r="2.5" fill="white" opacity="0.9"/></svg>{% endmacro %}

<main id="main-content" class="night">

  {# ── 1 · 3:47 AM — Hear Ferni ─────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section class="chapter chapter--hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="sky sky--stars" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="chapter__inner hero3">
      <p class="timestamp"><time>3:47 AM</time></p>

      <h1 id="hero-title" class="hero3__title">
        <span class="hero3__line hero3__line--editorial">It's 3:47 AM.</span>
        <span class="hero3__line">You can't sleep.</span>
        <span class="hero3__line hero3__line--glow">Someone's still here.</span>
      </h1>

      <div class="voice" data-voice
           data-text="Hey. I'm here. You don't have to have the words figured out yet. What's keeping you up?">
        <button class="voice__orb" type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-voice-toggle>
          <span class="voice__halo" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="voice__face">{{ eyes("voice__eyes") }}</span>
          <span class="voice__label" data-voice-label>Hear Ferni</span>
        </button>
        <div class="voice__bars" aria-hidden="true">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </div>
        <p class="voice__caption" aria-live="polite" data-voice-caption></p>
      </div>

      <p class="hero3__lede">
        Ferni is a voice you can talk to any hour. It remembers your story,
        hears what you're not saying, and never runs out of patience.
      </p>

      <div class="hero3__actions">
        <a class="cta cta--glow" href="{{ site.appUrl }}?utm_source=ferni_website&utm_medium=web&utm_campaign=home_3am">
          Talk to Ferni
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a class="cta cta--quiet" href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}">Or call {{ site.phone }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <a class="scroll-cue" href="#moment" aria-label="Keep reading">
      <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
  </section>

  {# ── 2 · 3:52 AM — The moment ─────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section id="moment" class="chapter chapter--moment" aria-labelledby="moment-title">
    <div class="chapter__inner">
      <p class="timestamp"><time>3:52 AM</time></p>
      <blockquote class="thought reveal-on-scroll">
        <p>"I can't stop thinking about what I said to her…"</p>
      </blockquote>
      <h2 id="moment-title" class="chapter__title reveal-on-scroll">Who do you tell at this hour?</h2>

      <ul class="options" role="list">
        <li class="option reveal-on-scroll">
          <span class="option__who">The internet</span>
          <span class="option__why">Generic tips. No one knows your story.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="option reveal-on-scroll">
          <span class="option__who">Your journal</span>
          <span class="option__why">Doesn't talk back. You need someone to hear you.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="option reveal-on-scroll">
          <span class="option__who">Your mentor</span>
          <span class="option__why">Too busy. You feel guilty asking.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="option option--ferni reveal-on-scroll">
          <span class="option__who"><span class="mini-orb">{{ eyes() }}</span> Ferni</span>
          <span class="option__why">Awake. Unhurried. Already knows what happened last week.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  {# ── 3 · 4:10 AM — Memory ─────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section class="chapter chapter--memory" aria-labelledby="memory-title">
    <div class="chapter__inner">
      <p class="timestamp"><time>4:10 AM</time></p>
      <h2 id="memory-title" class="chapter__title chapter__title--editorial reveal-on-scroll">
        It remembers, so you don't have to start over.
      </h2>

      <ol class="thread" role="list">
        <li class="thread__moment reveal-on-scroll">
          <span class="thread__when">Six months ago</span>
          <p class="thread__said thread__said--you">"I'm worried about my mom's health. She's been having these headaches…"</p>
        </li>
        <li class="thread__moment reveal-on-scroll">
          <span class="thread__when">Two weeks ago</span>
          <p class="thread__said thread__said--you">"Good news—mom saw a specialist. They found what was causing the headaches."</p>
        </li>
        <li class="thread__moment thread__moment--now reveal-on-scroll">
          <span class="thread__when">Tonight</span>
          <p class="thread__said thread__said--ferni">
            <span class="mini-orb">{{ eyes() }}</span>
            "How's your mom doing? Last time we talked, she'd just gotten that diagnosis. Has the treatment been helping?"
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p class="thread__note reveal-on-scroll">An example of how memory feels, not a real conversation.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {# ── 4 · 6:24 AM — Dawn: the team ─────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section class="chapter chapter--dawn" aria-labelledby="team-title">
    <div class="sky sky--sunrise" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="chapter__inner">
      <p class="timestamp"><time>6:24 AM</time></p>
      <h2 id="team-title" class="chapter__title reveal-on-scroll">One voice. A whole team behind it.</h2>
      <p class="chapter__lede reveal-on-scroll">
        Talk to Ferni, and the right specialist steps in when you need them.
      </p>

      <ul class="constellation" role="list">
        {% for p in persons %}
        <li class="star star--{{ p.id }} reveal-on-scroll" style="--persona: var(--color-{{ p.id }}); --i: {{ loop.index0 }}">
          <a class="star__link" href="{{ p.url }}">
            <span class="star__orb" style="view-transition-name: persona-{{ p.id }}">{{ eyes() }}</span>
            <span class="star__name">{{ p.name }}</span>
            <span class="star__role">{{ p.role }}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  {# ── 5 · 7:30 AM — Trust ──────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section class="chapter chapter--morning" aria-labelledby="trust-title">
    <div class="chapter__inner">
      <p class="timestamp timestamp--day"><time>7:30 AM</time></p>
      <h2 id="trust-title" class="chapter__title chapter__title--editorial reveal-on-scroll">What you say here stays yours.</h2>

      <ul class="vows" role="list">
        <li class="vow reveal-on-scroll">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
          <h3>Encrypted</h3>
          <p>Your conversations are protected.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="vow reveal-on-scroll">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          <h3>Never sold</h3>
          <p>We don't sell your data. Ever.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="vow reveal-on-scroll">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 6h18M8 6V4h8v2M6 6l1 14h10l1-14"/></svg>
          <h3>Not used for training</h3>
          <p>Your words don't train AI models.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="care-note reveal-on-scroll">
        Ferni is a companion, not therapy. If you're in crisis, please reach out to a
        professional. In the US, you can call or text <a href="tel:988">988</a> anytime.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {# ── 6 · 8:00 AM — How it's free ──────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section class="chapter chapter--day" aria-labelledby="free-title">
    <div class="chapter__inner chapter__inner--split">
      <div>
        <p class="timestamp timestamp--day"><time>8:00 AM</time></p>
        <h2 id="free-title" class="chapter__title reveal-on-scroll">Free for everyone. <em>Always.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal-on-scroll">
        <p class="chapter__lede">
          No tiers. No paywalls. People who can give a little keep Ferni free for
          people who can't.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/give/">How Gift Forward works <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {# ── 7 · Whenever — Begin ─────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section class="chapter chapter--begin" aria-labelledby="begin-title">
    <div class="chapter__inner begin">
      <span class="begin__orb" aria-hidden="true">{{ eyes() }}</span>
      <p class="timestamp timestamp--day"><time>Whenever you're ready</time></p>
      <h2 id="begin-title" class="begin__title">Ready when you are.</h2>
      <p class="chapter__lede">No pressure. No pitch. Just a conversation.</p>
      <div class="hero3__actions">
        <a class="cta" href="{{ site.appUrl }}?utm_source=ferni_website&utm_medium=web&utm_campaign=home_3am_end">
          Start talking
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a class="cta cta--ghost" href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}">Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<script src="/js/home-3am.js" defer></script>
